[{:db/id "q-90791/selection/bcab8ddd652e4f7ddf6781c44613e40d2fdc38f851a9fe5e1fba93f3572491e3" :answer/id #uuid "537c3cbe-d61a-53bc-ae41-9fd3ab4e9861" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=7\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791/selection/e73f344dd2a3b5b2ca73ba5308234cc5231304ec4736fae49c24e14feea03c08" :answer/id #uuid "045eb8ac-cb68-53c8-9cd2-a9f113e0a7ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791/selection/da23193517c38980f1d8f5e9a39951bda6f1ab84bcae826748816ec3f38d8a34" :answer/id #uuid "7d8a8c3c-65f1-5161-8721-c4759766ebc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791/selection/8372f2de01230bd4130b6afe7df4bbddf09d1913b0dcc01bff706003968610ac" :answer/id #uuid "e5ec1f66-c3ba-5520-aa6e-2c7d9fc5029f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791/selection/5e13a81885d35aefa22bcf8841194a8e4bed978d74f948b87409cee0ba178aef" :answer/id #uuid "a51c1ab7-25db-5e41-8a3d-46eb094465d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+7\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "98172f93-1476-5b7e-9a4e-8d513aaf89bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-90791/selection/8372f2de01230bd4130b6afe7df4bbddf09d1913b0dcc01bff706003968610ac" :answer-field/choices ["q-90791/selection/bcab8ddd652e4f7ddf6781c44613e40d2fdc38f851a9fe5e1fba93f3572491e3" "q-90791/selection/e73f344dd2a3b5b2ca73ba5308234cc5231304ec4736fae49c24e14feea03c08" "q-90791/selection/da23193517c38980f1d8f5e9a39951bda6f1ab84bcae826748816ec3f38d8a34" "q-90791/selection/8372f2de01230bd4130b6afe7df4bbddf09d1913b0dcc01bff706003968610ac" "q-90791/selection/5e13a81885d35aefa22bcf8841194a8e4bed978d74f948b87409cee0ba178aef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-90791" :question/id #uuid "51ec48c3-c8fe-5439-9c0f-70a1c419805c" :question/math-academy-id "q-90791" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+49y=0,\\,y(0)=-2,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=7.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+49{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+49) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+49=0.\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+49 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-49 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 7\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow let's find the constants $P$ and $Q.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(0)=-2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nP=-2.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=7.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-7P\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x+7Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=7$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n7Q=7.\n$$\n\nSo we have $P=-2$ and $Q=1.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-90791/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0bf8bb23-741b-5583-b51c-67eabae0ab54"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-90791"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection/ce17d06798d549aa8fc3ba1964b34b6853f9f90a61f249c1457ffa255184fa1a" :answer/id #uuid "76900187-d12a-5e50-aa46-b765cb8a5881" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+4\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection/f76772b0512aa9e03d025ad282b1d6553267536a2d529f85b9a3b6dc9b8227b3" :answer/id #uuid "0e559aac-bcef-5150-abb6-d86561fbd26c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection/82ebc3dc05af89e8a3822e824437d2ad53e5745b2bef61d0234eae79c396bf83" :answer/id #uuid "bf7e2965-61ac-5680-b703-0a7b2b1cabdd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection/3eb2ba39a77fa2a12e1bb7ab73e81223bb6ad773573d1c04ae325fb8ff2a6632" :answer/id #uuid "7843e8ce-9abf-53d0-9929-2e378a91edc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection/d222592e79f8cdef7d5a034a75f25633765db0fc9dc52c82951f5c94e2f0ae29" :answer/id #uuid "8fe7e802-a24e-5f34-a949-d53d2f8b7709" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "45cd4293-895d-5e0e-b70a-39373cec5441" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-90793/selection/f76772b0512aa9e03d025ad282b1d6553267536a2d529f85b9a3b6dc9b8227b3" :answer-field/choices ["q-90793/selection/ce17d06798d549aa8fc3ba1964b34b6853f9f90a61f249c1457ffa255184fa1a" "q-90793/selection/f76772b0512aa9e03d025ad282b1d6553267536a2d529f85b9a3b6dc9b8227b3" "q-90793/selection/82ebc3dc05af89e8a3822e824437d2ad53e5745b2bef61d0234eae79c396bf83" "q-90793/selection/3eb2ba39a77fa2a12e1bb7ab73e81223bb6ad773573d1c04ae325fb8ff2a6632" "q-90793/selection/d222592e79f8cdef7d5a034a75f25633765db0fc9dc52c82951f5c94e2f0ae29"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-90793" :question/id #uuid "4820ea55-118f-5bdc-96e7-abfb76af12b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-90793" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+100y=0,\\,y(0)=5,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=20.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+100{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+100) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+100=0.\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+100 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-100 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 10\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow let's find the constants $P$ and $Q.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(0)=5$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nP=5.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=20.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-10P\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+10Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=20$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n10Q=20.\n$$\n\nSo we have $P=5$ and $Q=2.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-90793/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0bf8bb23-741b-5583-b51c-67eabae0ab54"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-90793"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection/5ca3aee2747cd28e076340f456077b4c0e232d837149192f6a897aab79008677" :answer/id #uuid "84659441-44fa-5813-9b00-6bf955b67847" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection/d3d8a4e5abfd2ee84e77a4146712d52af8d278d197318a2da29e17f9588a0c9b" :answer/id #uuid "02d893cb-b711-5028-8eba-85393bde49bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection/10c1e3aa8182c1d3f41b4d67aeb797e8cecd489fc60b9c0928cdb4321569af03" :answer/id #uuid "8dca77ea-6d5d-57a0-ae89-6aa44f5ca238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection/67717e8d6a0b7a426ea5864f1f3c4d5c26efcadf99aaaa34eb8c630ad308f79b" :answer/id #uuid "f9d68983-7f1e-51ac-b62d-0097761fa5b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection/00a3397ec3e6adeeb0f3ee45292111821e724f5d0e832966bb2f21e3eaa0f76b" :answer/id #uuid "92de3964-d7e4-588e-bc3f-0dd2d853c4f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3\\sqrt{3}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3\\sqrt{3}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130155/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "521be9d4-1cef-5e12-b31c-7fbfe2ac7993" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130155/selection/5ca3aee2747cd28e076340f456077b4c0e232d837149192f6a897aab79008677" :answer-field/choices ["q-130155/selection/5ca3aee2747cd28e076340f456077b4c0e232d837149192f6a897aab79008677" "q-130155/selection/d3d8a4e5abfd2ee84e77a4146712d52af8d278d197318a2da29